PASS initial: index, delta, elapsed, rate all zero
PASS first pass: delta and elapsed zero, index zero
PASS second pass: index one, delta and elapsed positive
PASS one stamp per pass: repeated reads agree
PASS monotonic run: index steps one, elapsed never backward
PASS rate: positive after passes with positive delta
PASS sequence: index stays in [0, count)
PASS sequence: zero count or non-positive period holds frame zero
PASS pulse: the two-phase sequence's first phase, false when period <= 0
PASS single-frame sequence: always frame zero
PASS reset: index, delta, elapsed, rate all zero
PASS reset then stamp: first pass zero again
clock relay: PASS
